\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.5}{\ignorespaces Along the augmenting path s→2→4→t, the bottleneck is 8 (limited by edge 2→4, capacity 8), bringing the total flow to 8. Edge s→2 still has 10 $-$ 8 = 2 units of residual capacity, which are routed along path s→2→3→4→t through edge 2→3 (capacity 2), saturating s→2 and raising the total flow to 10. Finally, the augmenting path s→3→4→5→t has bottleneck 6, yielding a total flow of 10 + 6 = 16.}}{43}{figure.5.5}\protected@file@percent }
